guide polestar-completionist-alliance/class-priest
title Priest class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Alliance
class Priest
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Priest class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Priest quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
# Drafted from the reference data and repaired from lint: not yet played.
# Routed 11 quests; estimated level at the end 13.5 (heuristic XP).
# Skipped: 30 exclusive with N; 1 objective N (kill N) outside the zones.

